WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,450
I imprison the boy from Xia Kingdom for his extraordinary skills

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:05,930
It's better to be cautious

3
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:08,530
What if he gets through the heavy defenses?

4
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:11,520
Kill the master sword

5
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,280
do you mean

6
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:15,040
The sword team of my majestic Great Sword Island

7
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:20,000
I still can’t stop a few teenagers

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,240
Great sword island warriors listen

9
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,640
I am the son of the sword master

10
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,000
You are Zicong, the future master of Jiandao

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,560
A few little thieves from Xia Kingdom

12
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,080
You dare to charge at my main sword

13
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,360
Kill your commander

14
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:33,840
Don’t you agree?

15
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,400
Now I command you

16
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,680
Put these people who do not know life and death

17
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,840
The people of Xia were cut into pieces for them to see

18
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,720
What will happen if you dare to provoke Jiandao Weiyan?

19
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:45,240
Victory will be witnessed by me and you. Kill me and Xiaosong is right here.

20
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,520
Be with my sword

21
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:48,640
Killing with all of you
